<title>USA: Camden, S.C., yields 5.85 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Camden, S.C., yields 5.85 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford &amp; Co said it priced $20.425 million of Camden, S.C., public utility revenue refunding bonds, with a top yield of 5.85 percent in 2027.</p>
